  "plain": "Dylan Borland, a former intelligence official, is said to have told the Inspector General of the Intelligence Community, a watchdog Corbell calls \"the police of the intelligence agencies,\" that a secret UFO program exists and is \"called Rubik's Cube.\" The filmmaker Jeremy Corbell says he heard this in the 2020s from someone at the Office of the Director of National Intelligence, which oversees America's spy agencies, and once describes that person as a lead of the office's \"Director's Initiative\" group. He tells it twice, naming the program in one telling and the group lead's role in the other."
